<title>USA: Suzuki February US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Suzuki February US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suzuki Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Feb 1-28, 1997     Feb 1-29, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		 192		 637	    -68.6</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	     344		 929	    -61.4</p>
<p> Import Car		   563		 558	     +5.1</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,115	     1,405	    -17.3</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Feb 28, 1997 Jan 1-Feb 29, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		 293	     1,455	    -79.5</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	     631	     1,644	    -60.9</p>
<p> Import Car		 2,023	     1,273	    +62.1</p>
<p> Import Truck	     2,227	     2,417	     -6.0</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 50 for year to date vs 51 in year ago.</p>
</text>
